stateDiagram-v2
    %% The committed bot (bots/baseline): the modes a champion is in between
    %% turns, and the events that move it. Thresholds live in strategy.h.

    [*] --> Alive

    state Alive {
        state "At spawn" as Spawn
        state "Farming" as Farming
        state "Fighting" as Fighting
        state "Retreating" as Retreating
        state "Banking" as Banking

        [*] --> Spawn
        Spawn --> Farming: healed and shopped

        state Farming {
            direction LR
            state "Choose group" as choose
            state "Travel" as travel
            state "Clear" as clear
            state "Hold capture" as hold
            state "Wait respawn" as wait
            [*] --> choose
            choose --> travel
            travel --> clear: in reach
            clear --> hold: cleared
            hold --> wait: paid
            wait --> clear: respawns
            wait --> choose: another group
        }

        Farming --> Fighting: enemy in view
        Fighting --> Farming: nothing left to fight
        Farming --> Banking: bag trigger
        Banking --> Farming: banked, or stuck
        Banking --> Fighting: under fire at the altar
        Fighting --> Retreating: hurt, or too dangerous
        Farming --> Retreating: hurt
        Banking --> Retreating: the channel left would kill us
        Retreating --> Fighting: caught and the duel is won
        Retreating --> Spawn: walks or recalls home
        Farming --> Spawn: capture paid, recalls home
    }

    Alive --> Dead: killed
    Dead --> Alive: respawns

    note right of Spawn
        Heals to full, buys all it can afford, strikes what reaches it.
        Within a turn, when several apply: fight, retreat, bank, help, farm.
    end note
    note right of Farming
        Group choice: reward per round of walk, clear and capture, discounted
        by enemies on the way; a party or a cluster run when better.
        Hold: step on unless an ally outranks; go home when nobody is near
        and hurt, rich, or on a short trip.
    end note
    note right of Fighting
        Also entered to chase a lone runner, or to help a teammate under
        attack (a sighting alone brings nobody).
        Each turn: victim, risk gate, tile score, then step, dash, combo,
        spell, attack. Hurt: own strength counts zero, safest tile.
    end note
    note left of Retreating
        Latched until healed at spawn. Keeps reporting the fight.
        Recalls when out of reach and home is far, else walks.
    end note
    note left of Banking
        Trigger: deadline, near-victory share, capture combo, winning bag,
        or gems on the way out of spawn. Altar: nearest by walk,
        enemies nearby count against it.
    end note
